            {
              "id": "private.analysis-incomplete",
              "name": "PrivateAnalysisIncomplete",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Compressed private data built to exhaust analysis"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "The decompressed content of a private value floods the signature search with decoys, so part of it could not be inspected."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Part of the file was not inspected, so the verdict for it is partial. Inspect the reported range with other tools. A file that deliberately exhausts analysis budgets should be treated as hostile.",
                "markdown": "The decompressed content of a private value floods the signature search with decoys, so part of it could not be inspected.\n\n**What to do:** Part of the file was not inspected, so the verdict for it is partial. Inspect the reported range with other tools. A file that deliberately exhausts analysis budgets should be treated as hostile."
