            {
              "id": "private.compressed-payload",
              "name": "PrivateCompressedPayload",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "File hidden inside compressed private data"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "A zlib or gzip private value decompresses to data containing a recognised file format. Compression hides it from any signature search of the file itself."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Quarantine the file and keep it away from anything that could run or extract the embedded content. Extract the payload at the reported offset for malware analysis, find out how the file entered the archive, and check other files from the same source. Re-saving the file in a viewer is not a fix: it may keep the payload, and it destroys evidence.",
                "markdown": "A zlib or gzip private value decompresses to data containing a recognised file format. Compression hides it from any signature search of the file itself.\n\n**What to do:** Quarantine the file and keep it away from anything that could run or extract the embedded content. Extract the payload at the reported offset for malware analysis, find out how the file entered the archive, and check other files from the same source. Re-saving the file in a viewer is not a fix: it may keep the payload, and it destroys evidence."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/Aahil-Riyaz/radguard/blob/main/docs/rules.md#privatecompressed-payload",
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              },
              "properties": {
