            {
              "id": "private.duplicate-creator",
              "name": "PrivateDuplicateCreator",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Private Creator reserves two blocks"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "One creator name reserves two blocks of the same group; readers that look a creator up by name find one block or the other."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Different DICOM software can read this file differently, so no single viewer's rendering can be trusted. Compare what the viewer, the PACS and any AI pipeline actually show; to normalise the study, re-acquire it from the source, or rewrite it with a strict toolkit and scan it again.",
                "markdown": "One creator name reserves two blocks of the same group; readers that look a creator up by name find one block or the other.\n\n**What to do:** Different DICOM software can read this file differently, so no single viewer's rendering can be trusted. Compare what the viewer, the PACS and any AI pipeline actually show; to normalise the study, re-acquire it from the source, or rewrite it with a strict toolkit and scan it again.\n\n**References:**\n- <https://dicom.nema.org/medical/dicom/current/output/chtml/part05/sect_7.8.html>"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/Aahil-Riyaz/radguard/blob/main/docs/rules.md#privateduplicate-creator",
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "note"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "security",
                  "differential",
                  "external/cwe/cwe-436"
                ],
                "precision": "very-high",
                "security-severity": "2.0"
