              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Required by PS3.10; some readers mis-locate the dataset without it."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Usually a buggy or non-conforming writer rather than an attack. Note the producing software (Implementation Class UID and Version Name in the File Meta Information) and report the defect to its vendor if it recurs.",
                "markdown": "Required by PS3.10; some readers mis-locate the dataset without it.\n\n**What to do:** Usually a buggy or non-conforming writer rather than an attack. Note the producing software (Implementation Class UID and Version Name in the File Meta Information) and report the defect to its vendor if it recurs."
