            {
              "id": "structure.no-part10-header",
              "name": "StructureNoPart10Header",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "No DICOM Part 10 header"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Strict readers reject the file but lenient ones (pydicom's force mode, many toolkits) read it, so tools that only look for the DICM marker skip it entirely."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Different DICOM software can read this file differently, so no single viewer's rendering can be trusted. Compare what the viewer, the PACS and any AI pipeline actually show; to normalise the study, re-acquire it from the source, or rewrite it with a strict toolkit and scan it again.",
                "markdown": "Strict readers reject the file but lenient ones (pydicom's force mode, many toolkits) read it, so tools that only look for the DICM marker skip it entirely.\n\n**What to do:** Different DICOM software can read this file differently, so no single viewer's rendering can be trusted. Compare what the viewer, the PACS and any AI pipeline actually show; to normalise the study, re-acquire it from the source, or rewrite it with a strict toolkit and scan it again."
