            {
              "id": "values.document-payload",
              "name": "ValuesDocumentPayload",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Executable inside an encapsulated document"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "An Encapsulated Document (0042,0011), meant to hold a PDF, CDA or similar report, contains an executable."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Quarantine the file and keep it away from anything that could run or extract the embedded content. Extract the payload at the reported offset for malware analysis, find out how the file entered the archive, and check other files from the same source. Re-saving the file in a viewer is not a fix: it may keep the payload, and it destroys evidence.",
                "markdown": "An Encapsulated Document (0042,0011), meant to hold a PDF, CDA or similar report, contains an executable.\n\n**What to do:** Quarantine the file and keep it away from anything that could run or extract the embedded content. Extract the payload at the reported offset for malware analysis, find out how the file entered the archive, and check other files from the same source. Re-saving the file in a viewer is not a fix: it may keep the payload, and it destroys evidence."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/Aahil-Riyaz/radguard/blob/main/docs/rules.md#valuesdocument-payload",
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
