            {
              "id": "values.document-type-mismatch",
              "name": "ValuesDocumentTypeMismatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Encapsulated document is not what it claims"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "The declared MIME type and the content disagree: software that trusts the declared type and software that sniffs the content handle the document differently."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Different DICOM software can read this file differently, so no single viewer's rendering can be trusted. Compare what the viewer, the PACS and any AI pipeline actually show; to normalise the study, re-acquire it from the source, or rewrite it with a strict toolkit and scan it again.",
                "markdown": "The declared MIME type and the content disagree: software that trusts the declared type and software that sniffs the content handle the document differently.\n\n**What to do:** Different DICOM software can read this file differently, so no single viewer's rendering can be trusted. Compare what the viewer, the PACS and any AI pipeline actually show; to normalise the study, re-acquire it from the source, or rewrite it with a strict toolkit and scan it again."
