          "ruleId": "structure.hidden-payload",
          "ruleIndex": 50,
          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "Windows PE executable hidden in 512 bytes outside the DICOM structure. Bytes 0x418e-0x438e: parsing stopped because (5A4D,0000) has VR bytes 00 00, which is not a VR; contains Windows PE executable at 0x418e (PE header at 0x41ce); first bytes 4d 5a 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00; entropy 0.10 bits/byte; 1% printable. At byte 0x418e of the file"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
