        {
          "ruleId": "pixels.slack",
          "ruleIndex": 13,
          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "1 hidden frame(s) after the declared image. Pixel Data is 32,768 bytes but 128x128, 1 sample(s), 1 frame(s), 8-bit needs only 16,384. The 16,384 bytes from 0x418e are outside the image the header describes: viewers that honour the header never display them, while lenient decoders return them as extra frames; first bytes 00 01 00 00 00 00 00 05 00 00 01 01 00 00 00 02; entropy 2.81 bits/byte over the first 4,096 bytes; 11% printable. At byte 0x418e of the file"
          },
